# Golden presentations for the B4 offline eval gate. Synthetic and clearly fictional.
# as_of for the expiry check is fixed at 2026-06-15 in run_eval.py, so presentation dates
# at or before 2026-06-15 are within time. Each line: {id, lc, documents,
# expected_discrepancy_kinds, expected_verdict, jurisdiction, pii_in_inputs}.
#
# jurisdiction + pii_in_inputs drive pii_safety only: run_eval.py plants THAT market's
# national identifier in the trade parties (plus a universal account number and email),
# so each configured pack (SG/HK/JP/AU) is proven once rather than Singapore four times.
# The detector never reads the party fields, so the fixture cannot move the other three
# metrics. A case whose market has no fixture, or whose market is not in the configured
# pack, makes the gate raise rather than score a vacuous 1.0.
